"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 200% of normal in April to May and 24% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 18759 down at 52% that year.</p>"}
